      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent 1: SEO Strategist (Keyword Backlog + GSC fallback)\n\n**Cadence:** weekly (Mon 06:00 UTC) ≈ 4 posts/month per the 2026-06-08 SEO strategy.\n\n**Primary source:** Keyword Backlog table 1022496 (curated 3-layer keyword plan, Status=queued, by Priority; row marked used immediately after pick).\n**Fallback:** GSC striking distance (pos 11-30, ≥50 impressions, top 1).\n\nBrief → Claude Haiku → dedup vs blog table (HTTP node — Code nodes CANNOT use fetch, that bug stalled the pipeline May 20 → Jun 10) → idea_generated row.\n\nPositioning: enterprise AI for regulated industries (PE/M&A, wealth/RIA, legal, CPA, financial services).",
